true, "audio": "audio/793351b6f64375af23ae.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "moći će", "en": "he will be able", "tr": "güç yetirecek", "fr": "il pourra", "id": "dia akan mampu", "ur": "وہ قدرت رکھے گا", "bn": "সে সক্ষম হবে", "fa": "خواهد توانست"}}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَحَدٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "22:74", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2669.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "They measure not Allah His rightful measure. Lo! Allah is Strong, Almighty.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Allah'ın büyüklüğünü gereği gibi değerlendirip bilemediler. Şüphesiz ki Allah çok kuvvetlidir, her şeye üstündür.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اللہ کی قدر نہ جانی جیسی چاہیے تھی بیشک اللہ قوت والا غالب ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mereka tidak mengenal Allah dengan sebenar-benarnya. Sesungguhnya Allah benar-benar Maha Kuat lagi Maha Perkasa.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "مَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَدَرُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/70991f9c891ebc4c6e2e.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they appraised", "bs": "cijenili su", "tr": "değerlendirdiler", "fr": "ils ont évalué", "id": "mereka telah menilai", "ur": "انہوں نے اندازہ کیا", "bn": "তারা মূল্যায়ন করল", "fa": "ارزیابی کردند"}}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "حَقَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَدْرِهِۦٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَقَوِىٌّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَزِيزٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "77:23", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5645.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Thus We arranged. How excellent is Our arranging!", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Demek ki biçimlendirmişiz. Ne güzel biçimlendireniz biz.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "پھر ہم نے اندازہ فرمایا، تو ہم کیا ہی اچھے قادر", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "lalu Kami tentukan (bentuknya), maka Kami-lah sebaik-baik yang menentukan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَقَدَرْنَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/ad893877dd294f4d40d6.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa smo odredili", "en": "so We measured", "tr": "böylece takdir ettik", "fr": "alors Nous avons mesuré", "id": "maka Kami menakar", "ur": "پھر ہم نے اندازہ کیا", "bn": "তখন আমরা পরিমাপ করলাম", "fa": "پس اندازه گرفتیم"}}, {"text": "فَنِعْمَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْقَٰدِرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "89:16", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6009.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "But whenever He trieth him by straitening his means of life, he saith: My Lord despiseth me.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ama her ne zaman da sınayıp rızkını daraltırsa, o vakit de, \"Rabbim beni zillete düşürdü.\" der.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اگر آزمائے اور اس کا رزق اس پر تنگ کرے، تو کہتا ہے میرے رب نے مجھے خوار کیا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Adapun bila Tuhannya mengujinya lalu membatasi rezekinya maka dia berkata: \"Tuhanku menghinakanku\"."